    "created_at": "2020-08-03T00:03:35Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-08-03T00:03:35Z",
    "body": "Interesting point. I never considered that the conjunctions should be part of explain. Perhaps a possible enhancement to the explain feature?\r\n\r\nTo answer your immediate question, it's being placed there by the conda module, as part of the model we adopted from spaceship where each module prints a join-word (I forget the actual term we use for it) between the previous module and itself.\r\n\r\nTo answer (what seems to be) your deeper question: these will be removable in v0.45.0. See https://github.com/starship/starship/discussions/1454 and https://github.com/starship/starship/discussions/1318 for details.",
