    "body": "Any way we could disable these join-words in the actual prompt?\r\n\r\nFor example, instead of `via 🦀 v1.45.0`, it would be cool to do something like `[🦀 v1.45.0]`\r\n\r\nI could submit a seperate issue, but I believe @jguhlin was also suggesting it would be nice to remove these from the prompt.",
